    {
      "selector": "#platform",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 2243,
      "heading": "One spine. Four disciplines.",
      "backgroundColor": "#EDE3CC",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "THE RECRUITING PLATFORM One spine. Four disciplines. 01 Verify, don't assume Every résumé line is checked against the transcript, the LinkedIn snapshot and the job description. A finding is either evidenced or it isn't. There is no in-between. 02 One pipeline, human-run Agents suggest a stage. A recruiter advances it. The board shows exactly where every candidate stands, nothing more. 03 Measured, not guessed STAR proportions, ownership ratio, trailing-off, scored from the transcript itself, the same way every time. 04 Nothing off the record Every login, flag and stage change writes to an appe",
      "layout": "grid",
      "assetUrls": [
        "http://localhost:8331/assets/img/shot-dashboard.png",
        "http://localhost:8331/assets/img/shot-pipeline.png",
        "http://localhost:8331/assets/img/shot-detail.png",
        "http://localhost:8331/assets/img/shot-audit.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": "#interview",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3073,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 755,
      "heading": "Scored the same way, every time.",
      "backgroundColor": "#1B1712",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "VERIFIED INTERVIEWS Scored the same way, every time. A live question. A console that says whether it is your turn or the model's, never that audio is happening when it isn't. STAR proportions the moment a session ends, scored by a fixed evaluator, not a guess. Consent before capture. A verified session cannot record without it. Practice never saves. Deterministic scoring. Situation, Task, Action, Result: the same evaluator, every session, no model in the loop. Ownership measured. First person against team voice, trailing answers flagged, not eyeballed.",
      "layout": "split",
      "assetUrls": [
        "http://localhost:8331/assets/img/shot-interview.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": "#features",
      "type": "features",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3829,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 863,
      "heading": "The rules live in the code.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FBF7EC",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "BUILT IN, NOT BOLTED ON The rules live in the code. Quarantine on ingest Every document is extracted, sanitized and structured before an agent ever reads it. Projection-gated views The candidate surface physically cannot return an internal field. It isn't hidden. It isn't there. No invented numbers Model output stating a figure absent from the evidence is rejected outright, not flagged for review. Consent before capture A verified interview cannot record without a signed consent gate. Practice sessions never save. Suggest, never decide Agents propose a stage, a gap, a flag. A human approves it",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "section",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4692,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 809,
      "heading": "Claimed. Verified.",
      "backgroundColor": "#1B1712",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "THE WHOLE IDEA, IN ONE TABLE Claimed. Verified. ELSEWHERE CERTAINTY A résumé line is taken at face value Checked against transcript, LinkedIn and the job description Screening notes, scattered across email and chat One evidence spine, one source of truth per candidate \"Strong communicator\": somebody's opinion STAR-scored and ownership-measured from the transcript A metric nobody can trace back Every figure grounded in a quote, or it doesn't ship An AI step nobody can audit Traced, contract-checked, and it fails closed",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#pricing",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5859,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 862,
      "heading": "Priced by the pipeline.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FBF7EC",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Start free",
        "Sign in to try",
        "Talk to us"
      ],
      "text": "PLANS Priced by the pipeline. Screening $0/seat One recruiter, one pipeline. Pipeline board Quarantine + audit 1 tenant module Start free MOST TEAMS Growth $48/seat/mo Submission builder, both studios. Everything in Screening Submission builder Resume + LinkedIn studios Verified interview sessions Sign in to try Scale Custom Multi-tenant, dedicated retention. Everything in Growth Multi-tenant isolation Custom retention policy Admin flow builder Talk to us",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
